     <div id="a-site_contents" class="a-site_contents  noskin"> 
      <article> 
       <div class="site_frame"> 
        <div class="g-column"> 
         <div id="a-main" class="a-main column -col12 "> 
          <section> 
           <div id="bk1339" class="b-plain c-space_normal c-sp-space_normal cssskin-_block_main init-block_animation" data-bk-id="bk1339" data-animated="bounceIn"> 
            <div class=" column -column1" id="news"> 
             <h2 class=" c-title c-center"> 
              <div style="font-size:80%;" data-font-size-num="80%"> 
               <div class="c-img   "> 
                <picture> 
                 <source type="image/webp" srcset="_src/3805/img20240520123102488523.webp?v=1793253214576"> 
                 <img src="_src/3805/img20240520123102488523.png?v=1793253214576" width="342" height="168" alt="" id="imgsrc3805_1" class=" c-no_adjust" loading="lazy"> 
                </picture> 
               </div> 
              </div></h2> 
             <div class="c-lead c-center"> 
              <span class=" c-center">お知らせとイベント情報</span> 
             </div> 
            </div> 
           </div> 
           <div id="bk13044" class="b-plain c-space_normal c-sp-space_normal c-padding_normal c-sp-padding_normal cssskin-sp3" data-bk-id="bk13044"> 
            <div class=" column -column1"> 
             <h4 class=" c-small_headline"><span style="color:#ff9900;" data-sitecolor-text="" class=" d-large_font">武蔵境秋のスクラッチキャンペーン</span><br><span><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">スクラッチカード配布期間</span></span><br><span><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">2026年11月1日(日)&nbsp; ～</span><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">15日(日)</span></span><br><span class=" d-small_font"><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">金券利用期間&nbsp;</span><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">2026年11月1日(日)&nbsp; ～30</span><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">日(月)</span></span></h4> 
             <p class=" c-body">&nbsp;<br><span class=" d-large_font"><span style="caret-color:#333333; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; font-variant-caps:normal; color:#333333; white-space:normal; letter-spacing:normal; text-rendering:optimizelegibility; font-style:normal; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px; text-indent:0px;" class=" d-bold d-gothic c-start">武蔵境では11月１日から秋のスクラッチキャンペーンを開催いたします。<br>1,000円の利用ごとにスクラッチカードを１枚プレゼントいたします。</span></span><span class=" d-large_font"></span><br><span style="color:#333333;" class=" d-large_font d-gothic"><span style="caret-color:#333333;"><span class=" d-bold">当たりのスクラッチカードは金券としてご利用いただけます。</span></span></span><br><span style="color:#333333;" class=" d-large_font d-gothic"><span style="caret-color:#333333;"><span class=" d-bold">ぜひ武蔵境でお買い物をお楽しみください。</span></span></span><br><span style="color:#333333;" class=" d-large_font d-gothic"><span style="caret-color:#333333;"><span class=" d-bold"><br><span><span class=" d-small_font">※おつりは出ません、現金との交換はできません。</span><br></span></span></span></span></p> 
            </div> 
           </div> 
           <div id="bk13043" class="b-plain c-space_normal c-sp-space_normal c-padding_normal c-sp-padding_normal cssskin-_block_main" data-bk-id="bk13043"> 
            <div class=" g-column -col2 -sp-col1"> 
             <div class=" column -column1"> 
              <div class=" c-body"> 
               <div class="c-img   "> 
